# This file used to set `node-linker=hoisted`, which pnpm 10 moved into
# pnpm-workspace.yaml as `nodeLinker` — so it had been silently ignored for
# some time and the workspace was installing isolated regardless.
#
# Do not restore it. Hoisting was tried (2026-08-10) to satisfy `expo doctor`'s
# duplicate-native-module check, which gates the EAS build. It fixed that, and
# broke `apps/site`: hoisting lifts express's cookie@0.7.2 (CommonJS) to the
# root, where it shadows the cookie@2.0.1 (ESM, exports parseCookie) that astro
# needs, and `astro build` dies in generatePages. cookie cannot be overridden to
# one version because express 5 calls parse/serialize, which cookie 2.x renamed.
#
# The duplicates are instead resolved by the `overrides` block in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml. See apps/native/RELEASES.md.
